# ShipGate Project

## Mission

Repo-policy-first quality orchestration. Ready by default. Projects declare intent; ShipGate executes tools via catalog metadata and canonical reports.

## Authoritative documentation

| Layer | Path |
| --- | --- |
| Design | `docs/sdd.md` |
